BT /F1 11 Tf 44 549.69 Td (Match the picture) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 530.29 Td (? Sensitive: "We'll keep today's service gentle and avoid anything that might sting.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 517.29 Td (? Flake / build-up: "We can look at a clearer cleanse and a lighter root routine.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 504.29 Td (? Shed: "Some increase can follow stress or illness a couple of months later. If it's heavy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 491.29 Td (or patchy, I'd rather you had it checked properly.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 478.29 Td (? Breakage: "This looks more like snap through the lengths than loss from the root. We can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 465.29 Td (ease chemistry and heat.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 452.29 Td (? Pattern: "We can style and colour in a way that is kinder to the scalp. Clearer answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 439.29 Td (need a clinician.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 426.29 Td (? Traction: "Looser tension and rotating styles would be kinder while we monitor this.") Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 44 401.89 Td (Recommend with limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 382.49 Td (Use: "Based on what I'm seeing, I'd suggest... The reason is... What it won't do is...") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364.09 Td (? Support comfort, manageability, appearance of density, less breakage) Tj ET
